  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a poster, I want the \"Smileys du forum\" section of the smiley panel (my forum-side favourite smileys), so that the picker matches legacy.\n\n### Scope\n\nGAP-087 lists \"forum favourites\" under LOT-104, but #195's scope and PR #459 do not cover it: no lot owns it. Legacy: `AnswerView.swift:1370-1380`, `ReplySmileyCatalog.swift` (`loadForumFavoriteSmileys`, `arrFavoritesSmileysForum`, filled by `SmileyViewController`/profile page). Needs the source of the forum favourites (profile parser `UserProfileSmiley`, LOT-027) and a refresh path: spec first, never guess HFR behaviour. Tap opens the detail, which also gives the first UI entry point to add an app favourite.\n\nFound by the Opus review of PR #459 (round 1, finding 1). Refs #195.\n\nAcceptance: section in `SmileyPickerView`, model tests, French strings, legacy pointer comments.",
